to
20 charges, and then bring the marker to a minimum of 50 charges. A
blessed scroll of charging will add 15 to 30 charges, and then bring
the
marker to a minimum of 50 charges (75 if between 51 and 74).

If it's empty, then an uncursed scroll of charging will be enough to
add
another 50 charges to the marker.  The best effect you could get with a

non empty marker and a blessed scroll would be having a marker at
(0:21)
and the scroll adding 30 charges, then bumping it up to a total of 75,
for a grand total of 54 charges being added.  So you're gambling on a 1

in 15 chance to get 4 extra charges. 14 times out of 15 you'll only get

29 extra charges though.

